'''Traveling Merchant''' (Japanese: '''旅の行商人''' ''Traveling Merchant'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Secluded Springs}} expansion.

